          "content": {
            "size": 4495,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "compression": 2557,
            "text": "{\"code\":0,\"message\":\"success\",\"data\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000021\",\"name\":\"那达慕大会\",\"nameEn\":\"Naadam\",\"type\":\"traditional\",\"ethnicGroupName\":\"蒙古族\",\"solarDate\":null,\"lunarDate\":\"农历六月初四前后\",\"origin\":\"源于祭祀敖包，后演变为体育竞技与商贸盛会。\",\"description\":\"赛马、摔跤、射箭被誉为\\\"男儿三艺\\\"，会场歌舞升平、商贸云集，是草原最盛大的节日。\",\"descriptionEn\":\"Horse racing, wrestling, and archery are hailed as the \\\"Three Manly Skills\\\"; the festival grounds resound with song and dance and bustle with traders — it is the grandest festival of the grasslands.\",\"descriptionEnSource\":\"machine\",\"customs\":[\"赛马\",\"摔跤\",\"射箭\",\"歌舞表演\"],\"images\":[\"/images/festival/naadam-u.webp\"],\"coverImage\":\"/images/festival/naadam-u.webp\"},{\"id\":\"10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000041\",\"name\":\"藏历新年\",\"nameEn\":\"Losar\",\"type\":\"traditional\",\"ethnicGroupName\":\"藏族\",\"solarDate\":null,\"lunarDate\":\"藏历正月初一\",\"origin\":\"源于藏历纪元，是藏族最隆重的传统节日。\",\"description\":\"年前清扫屋舍、制作\\\"切玛\\\"，初一清晨抢水祈福，走亲访友互致\\\"扎西德勒\\\"。\",\"descriptionEn\":\"Before the New Year, people clean their houses and make chemar; at dawn on the first day of the New Year they race to fetch the first water and offer prayers; they visit relatives and friends, greeting one another with \\\"Tashi Delek.\\\"\",\"descriptionEnSource\":\"machine\",\"customs\":[\"吃古突\",\"抢水\",\"拜年\",\"跳锅庄\"],\"images\":[\"/images/festival/losar-u.webp\"],\"coverImage\":\"/images/festival/losar-u.webp\"},{\"id\":\"10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031\",\"name\":\"开斋节\",\"nameEn\":\"Eid al-Fitr\",\"type\":\"religious\",\"ethnicGroupName\":\"回族\",\"solarDate\":null,\"lunarDate\":\"伊斯兰历十月一日\",\"origin\":\"斋月结束后的庆祝节日，回族最重要的节日之一。\",\"description\":\"清晨到清真寺举行会礼，随后走亲访友，互赠油香、馓子等美食，庆祝斋戒圆满。\",\"descriptionEn\":\"In the early morning, they go to the mosque for the Eid prayer, then visit relatives and friends, exchanging such delicacies as youxiang and sanzi to celebrate the completion of the fast.\",\"descriptionEnSource\":\"machine\",\"customs\":[\"会礼\",\"走亲访友\",\"吃油香\"],\"images\":[\"/images/festival/eid-al-fitr-u.webp\"],\"coverImage\":\"/images/festival/eid-al-fitr-u.webp\"},{\"id\":\"10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000032\",\"name\":\"古尔邦节\",\"nameEn\":\"Eid al-Adha\",\"type\":\"religious\",\"ethnicGroupName\":\"回族\",\"solarDate\":null,\"lunarDate\":\"伊斯兰历十二月十日\",\"origin\":\"伊斯兰教三大节日之一，又称\\\"宰牲节\\\"。\",\"description\":\"清晨会礼后宰牲分三份：自用、馈赠亲友、施舍贫者。\",\"descriptionEn\":\"After the morning Eid prayer, the sacrificed animal is divided into three shares: one for oneself, one to give to relatives and friends, and one to give to the poor.\",\"descriptionEnSource\":\"machine\",\"customs\":[\"会礼\",\"宰牲\",\"施舍\"],\"images\":[\"/images/festival/eid-al-adha-u.webp\"],\"coverImage\":\"/images/festival/eid-al-adha-u.webp\"},{\"id\":\"10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000023\",\"name\":\"马奶节\",\"nameEn\":\"Koumiss Festival\",\"type\":\"agricultural\",\"ethnicGroupName\":\"蒙古族\",\"solarDate\":null,\"lunarDate\":\"农历八月\",\"origin\":\"庆祝马奶丰收的草原节日。\",\"description\":\"以新挤的马奶祭天地，畅饮马奶酒，赛马、歌舞联欢。\",\"descriptionEn\":\"They offer freshly drawn mare's milk to heaven and earth, drink their fill of kumis, and join in horse racing, singing and dancing.\",\"descriptionEnSource\":\"machine\",\"customs\":[\"祭马奶\",\"饮马奶酒\",\"赛马\"],\"images\":[\"/images/festival/koumiss-festival-u.webp\"],\"coverImage\":\"/images/festival/koumiss-festival-u.webp\"},{\"id\":\"10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000033\",\"name\":\"圣纪节\",\"nameEn\":\"Mawlid\",\"type\":\"religious\",\"ethnicGroupName\":\"回族\",\"solarDate\":null,\"lunarDate\":\"伊斯兰历三月十二日\",\"origin\":\"纪念先知穆罕默德诞辰与归真。\",\"description\":\"清真寺诵经赞圣，讲述先知的生平事迹，聚餐庆贺。\",\"descriptionEn\":\"The mosque recites sutras and praises the Holy Prophet, recounts the Prophet's life story, and holds a communal feast in celebration.\",\"descriptionEnSource\":\"machine\",\"customs\":[\"诵经赞圣\",\"讲述生平\",\"聚餐\"],\"images\":[\"/images/festival/mawlid-u.webp\"],\"coverImage\":\"/images/festival/mawlid-u.webp\"}],\"total\":192},\"timestamp\":1789576466098}"
          },
