            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "compression": 2722,
            "text": "{\"code\":0,\"message\":\"success\",\"data\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000311\",\"name\":\"达斡尔族鲁日格勒\",\"nameEn\":\"Lurigele Dance\",\"category\":\"dance\",\"ethnicGroupName\":\"达斡尔族\",\"description\":\"以呼喊与跺步为节拍的传统舞蹈，模拟狩猎与家务，质朴豪放。\",\"descriptionEn\":\"A traditional dance with shouting and stamping as its beat, imitating hunting and household chores — plain and bold.\",\"descriptionEnSource\":\"machine\",\"origin\":\"鲁日格勒以呼喊与跺步为节拍，模拟狩猎与家务，可溯至达斡尔族古老的歌舞传统，质朴豪放。\",\"intangibleHeritage\":\"national\",\"inheritors\":[\"吴玉华\"],\"coverImage\":\"/images/art/lurigele-dance-u.webp\"},{\"id\":\"40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000371\",\"name\":\"仡佬族傩戏\",\"nameEn\":\"Gelao Nuo Opera\",\"category\":\"drama\",\"ethnicGroupName\":\"仡佬族\",\"description\":\"师公戴面具演傩戏，驱邪纳吉，保留远古祭祀遗风。\",\"descriptionEn\":\"Ritual masters wear masks to perform Nuo opera, warding off evil and welcoming good fortune, preserving the legacy of ancient sacrificial rites.\",\"descriptionEnSource\":\"machine\",\"origin\":\"仡佬族傩戏由师公戴面具演出，源于驱邪纳吉的祭祀，可溯至仡佬族古老的傩祭传统。\",\"intangibleHeritage\":\"national\",\"inheritors\":[\"杨朝忠\"],\"coverImage\":\"/images/art/gelao-nuo-opera-u.webp\"},{\"id\":\"40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031\",\"name\":\"花儿\",\"nameEn\":\"Hua'er\",\"category\":\"music\",\"ethnicGroupName\":\"回族\",\"description\":\"流行于西北的回族山歌，高亢悠长、即兴对唱，已列入人类非遗代表作名录。\",\"descriptionEn\":\"A Hui mountain song popular in the northwest, with its high-pitched, long-drawn melodies and improvised antiphonal singing, it has been inscribed on the Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity.\",\"descriptionEnSource\":\"machine\",\"origin\":\"花儿是流行于甘、青、宁等地的山歌，回族是主要传唱民族，可溯至明清。以高亢悠长的\\\"花儿令\\\"即兴对唱，莲花山、松鸣岩花儿会享誉四方。2009 年入选人类非遗代表作名录。\",\"intangibleHeritage\":\"world\",\"inheritors\":[\"马金山\"],\"coverImage\":\"/images/art/hua-er-u.webp\"},{\"id\":\"40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000051\",\"name\":\"十二木卡姆\",\"nameEn\":\"Twelve Muqam\",\"category\":\"music\",\"ethnicGroupName\":\"维吾尔族\",\"description\":\"集歌、舞、乐于一体的大型套曲，被誉为\\\"维吾尔音乐之母\\\"，已列入人类非遗名录。\",\"descriptionEn\":\"A grand suite integrating song, dance, and instrumental music, hailed as the \\\"mother of Uyghur music\\\" and inscribed on the Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity.\",\"descriptionEnSource\":\"machine\",\"origin\":\"木卡姆是维吾尔族传统音乐套曲，十二木卡姆集歌、舞、乐于一体，可溯至古代西域乐舞与伊斯兰音乐的交融。16 世纪叶尔羌汗国时期系统整理，2005 年入选人类非遗代表作名录。\",\"intangibleHeritage\":\"world\",\"inheritors\":[\"阿不都热合曼\"],\"coverImage\":\"/images/art/twelve-muqam-u.webp\"},{\"id\":\"40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000021\",\"name\":\"蒙古族长调\",\"nameEn\":\"Urtiin Duu (Mongolian Long Song)\",\"category\":\"music\",\"ethnicGroupName\":\"蒙古族\",\"description\":\"旋律悠长辽阔、气息绵延，描绘草原风光与游牧情怀，已列入人类非遗代表作名录。\",\"descriptionEn\":\"Its melody is long, vast, and drawn out, depicting the scenery of the grasslands and the sentiments of nomadic life; it has been inscribed on the Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity.\",\"descriptionEnSource\":\"machine\",\"origin\":\"长调是蒙古族在草原游牧生活中形成的古老民歌形式，可追溯至蒙古汗国时期。其旋律悠长、气息连绵，以\\\"诺古拉\\\"装饰音著称，承载游牧民族的审美与历史。2005 年与蒙古国联合入选人类非遗代表作名录。\",\"intangibleHeritage\":\"world\",\"inheritors\":[\"宝音德力格尔\"],\"coverImage\":\"/images/art/urtiin-duu-mongolian-long-song-u.webp\"},{\"id\":\"40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000032\",\"name\":\"回族服饰\",\"nameEn\":\"Hui Clothing\",\"category\":\"costume\",\"ethnicGroupName\":\"回族\",\"description\":\"男子戴白色无檐帽，女子戴盖头，服饰简洁素净，体现清真文化的审美。\",\"descriptionEn\":\"Men wear white skullcaps, and women wear headscarves; their clothing is simple and plain, reflecting the aesthetics of Halal culture.\",\"descriptionEnSource\":\"machine\",\"origin\":\"回族服饰以白帽、盖头与素净长袍为特征，伴随伊斯兰文化与中原服饰融合形成。清代以来，回族聚居区服饰自成体系，2006 年列入国家级非遗。\",\"intangibleHeritage\":\"national\",\"inheritors\":[],\"coverImage\":\"/images/art/hui-clothing-u.webp\"}],\"total\":165},\"timestamp\":1789576469729}"
          },
